  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ねえ、どうして……は奪うの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why... why did you take it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ねえ、どうしてウチから奪ったの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why did you steal it from me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ウチの前から
あの子はいなくなった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They took that girl from me...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>村で暮らしているあの子……
今はどうしてるの……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The one who lives in the village... What is she doing now?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47488</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カリン……そう、カリン……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Karin... Yes, that was her name...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47488</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>消えたカリン……
あの子は、今
どうしているのかしら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She went and disappeared... I wonder what she's doing now...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47716</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カリンさんは、もうすぐ
結婚するって言ってたよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She said she was gonna get married soon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カリンさんは
もうすぐ結婚するんだって。
とっても幸せそうだったよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She said she's getting married soon. She looked so happy, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、もうすぐ
結婚するって言ってたな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, she said she's gettin' married soon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カリンさんなら
もうすぐ結婚するって
嬉しそうに言ってたなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She was grinning ear to ear when she told us she was getting married soon!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カリンさんは
もうすぐ結婚すると言ってたわ。
とても幸せそうに</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She said she'll be getting married soon. The girl looked so happy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>レーブ村のカリンならば
間もなく結婚すると
発言していたが？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I believe the one known as Karin from Lof village said she was soon to be wed.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、結婚するのね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, so she's getting married...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>残されたのは最後の霧狐……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And leaving the fog foxes behind...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>霧に溶けこむ霧狐は
もうひとりきり……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Left all alone to fade into the mist...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お願い……
あの子にこれを見せて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please... Show her this...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>知らない……のね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Guess... you don't know...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
